Function create_app:
- read Settings via get_settings()
- configure structured logging
- construct FastAPI application
- attach session_factory plus all singleton services to app.state:
  - StorageService
  - GameDataRegistry
  - DataVersionService
  - CatalogService
  - CacheService
  - LeaderboardService
  - SessionService
  - AuthService
  - EventStreamService
  - MetricsService
  - BenchmarkService
  - AIRunService
  - AdminJobService
- register RequestIDMiddleware, routes, and exception handlers

Function main:
- read host/port/reload from Settings
- start uvicorn with app.main:app
